# Giant mosquito: hovers, darts.
# GandalfHardcore enemy pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable
# on its own). 64x64 cells. Row 0 idle, then the action rows. The world
# view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips to face the heading.

sheet mosquito.ppm
cell 64 64

bank MOSQUITO
seq IDLE loop ticks=3 : row 0 cols 0-3
seq WALK loop ticks=2 : row 1 cols 0-5
